  "vibe": "A social story film, built for the thumb. A deep violet ground washed with three saturated blooms and one electric lime accent; Archivo set heavy, tight and uppercase, stacked so each line lands on its own beat. Everything is a sticker card with a hard offset shadow rather than a panel in a UI, tilted a degree or two and snapping in from alternating sides. A segmented story bar runs across the top, one segment per scene, filling in real time. Authored portrait-first (9:16) as a native GSAP + DOM composition. Best for Reels, Shorts, TikTok, DTC launches and any brand that needs to stop a scroll in the first second.",
